#. metadata.json->name
msgid "ShutdownMenu-change"
msgstr "关机菜单（修改版）"

#. metadata.json->description
msgid "This is a Cinnamon panel applet that provides a menu with shutdown options and supports personalized actions via middle-click interaction. It was created by refactoring the code of ShutdownMenuWithIcons@LLOBERA to improve usability."
msgstr "这是一个 Cinnamon 面板小工具，提供包含关机选项的菜单，并支持通过鼠标中键交互进行个性化操作。本工具通过重构 ShutdownMenuWithIcons@LLOBERA 的代码而来，使其更易于使用。"

